<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>七七的数学思维 · 12 周训练计划</title>
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#f5f7fa;
  --card:#ffffff;
  --line:#e5e7eb;
  --text:#1f2937;
  --muted:#6b7280;
  --primary:#4f46e5;
  --primary-soft:#eef2ff;
  --warm:#f59e0b;
  --ok:#16a34a;
  --ok-soft:#e8f6ed;
  --warn:#d97706;
  --warn-soft:#fdf3e3;
  --bad:#dc2626;
  --bad-soft:#fdecec;
  --shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(16,24,40,.06), 0 8px 24px rgba(16,24,40,.05);
  --radius:14px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
html,body{margin:0;padding:0;}
body{
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei","Hiragino Sans GB","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
  font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.6;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
}
a{color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;}
a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;}

/* ---------- 顶部 ---------- */
header.top{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4f46e5 0%,#6366f1 55%,#7c8cf8 100%);
  color:#fff;padding:22px 0 26px;
}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px;}
.top h1{margin:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.5px;}
.top .sub{margin-top:6px;font-size:14px;opacity:.9;}
.top-tools{margin-top:14px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;}
.tbtn{
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);
  color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-size:13px;
  transition:background .15s;
}
.tbtn:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);}
.tbtn.on{background:#fff;color:var(--primary);font-weight:600;}

/* ---------- 固定流程 ---------- */
.flowbar{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:18px;
}
.flow{
  background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  padding:12px 14px;border-top:3px solid var(--primary);
}
.flow .step{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.5px;}
.flow .t{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;}
.flow .d{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;}
.timer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:8px;}
.timer .num{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--primary);}
.timer button{
  border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;
  padding:3px 10px;font-size:12px;color:var(--text);
}
.timer button:hover{border-color:var(--primary);color:var(--primary);}

/* ---------- 统计 ---------- */
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:12px;margin:18px 0;}
.stat{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:14px 16px;}
.stat .k{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);}
.stat .v{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;margin-top:2px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
.stat .v small{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted);}
.bar{height:6px;background:#eef0f4;border-radius:99px;margin-top:8px;overflow:hidden;}
.bar > i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--primary);border-radius:99px;transition:width .3s;}

.notice{
  background:var(--ok-soft);border:1px solid #bfe5cb;color:#146c37;
  border-radius:12px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:16px;
}
.notice.hidden{display:none;}
.notice b{font-weight:700;}

/* ---------- 布局 ---------- */
.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:212px 1fr;gap:18px;align-items:start;padding-bottom:40px;}
.side{position:sticky;top:16px;}
.side-title{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px 6px;letter-spacing:1px;}
.weekbtn{
  display:flex;width:100%;align-items:center;gap:9px;text-align:left;
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;
  padding:9px 11px;margin-bottom:7px;color:var(--text);font-size:13.5px;
  transition:all .15s;
}
.weekbtn:hover{border-color:#c7cbf5;transform:translateX(2px);}
.weekbtn.active{border-color:var(--primary);background:var(--primary-soft);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(79,70,229,.12);}
.weekbtn .no{
  flex:0 0 26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;background:#f1f2f7;color:var(--muted);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;
}
.weekbtn.active .no{background:var(--primary);color:#fff;}
.weekbtn .nm{flex:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}
.weekbtn .nm em{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:11px;color:#9ca3af;line-height:1.3;}
.weekbtn .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:#d1d5db;flex:0 0 8px;}
.weekbtn .dot.done{background:var(--ok);}
.weekbtn .dot.part{background:var(--warn);}

/* ---------- 周卡片 ---------- */
.weekcard{background:var(--card);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;}
.wc-head{
  padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fafbff,#fff);
}
.wc-head h2{margin:0;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;}
.wc-head .tag{
  font-size:12px;background:var(--primary-soft);color:var(--primary);
  padding:3px 10px;border-radius:99px;font-weight:600;
}
.wc-head .rate{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);}
.wc-head .rate b{color:var(--ok);font-size:16px;}
.videoline{
  padding:10px 20px;background:#fffdf6;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  font-size:13.5px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;
}
.videoline .lb{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;}

/* ---------- 天 ---------- */
.days{padding:6px 20px 16px;}
.day{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:14px;
  padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);
}
.day:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.day .dlab{
  text-align:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);
  background:#f3f4f8;border-radius:10px;padding:6px 0;height:fit-content;
}
.day.rest .dlab{background:#f0f9f4;color:#15803d;}
.day .dtxt{font-size:14.5px;}
.day .dtxt .q{font-family:"Consolas","Courier New",monospace;background:#f6f7fb;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:5px;}
.ans{
  margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#334155;background:#f8fafc;
  border-left:3px solid #cbd5e1;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;
}
.ans b{color:var(--primary);}
.ans.hidden{display:none;}
.marks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:10px;align-items:center;}
.mk{
  border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:99px;
  padding:5px 13px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;
  transition:all .15s;
}
.mk:hover{border-color:#9ca3af;}
.mk.s-ok.on{background:var(--ok-soft);border-color:var(--ok);color:#15803d;font-weight:600;}
.mk.s-warn.on{background:var(--warn-soft);border-color:var(--warn);color:#b45309;font-weight:600;}
.mk.s-bad.on{background:var(--bad-soft);border-color:var(--bad);color:#b91c1c;font-weight:600;}
.mk .sym{font-size:15px;line-height:1;}
.say{margin-top:9px;}
.say input{
  width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 12px;
  font-size:13.5px;font-family:inherit;color:var(--text);background:#fcfcfd;
}
.say input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--primary);background:#fff;}
.say .ph{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:4px;}

.wc-foot{padding:12px 20px 18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#fcfcfe;}
.wc-foot label{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);display:block;margin-bottom:5px;}
.wc-foot textarea{
  width:100%;min-height:56px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;
  padding:9px 12px;font-family:inherit;font-size:13.5px;resize:vertical;color:var(--text);
}
.wc-foot textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--primary);}

.legend{
  margin-top:14px;background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);
}
.legend b{color:var(--text);}
.legend .row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin-top:6px;}
.legend .row span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}

/* ---------- 每日步骤打勾 ---------- */
.steps{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:11px;align-items:center;}
.st{
  border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:9px;
  padding:5px 11px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);
  display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;transition:all .15s;line-height:1.4;
}
.st:hover{border-color:#9ca3af;color:var(--text);}
.st i{
  width:15px;height:15px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:4px;
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:11px;font-style:normal;color:transparent;flex:0 0 15px;line-height:1;
}
.st.on{background:var(--primary-soft);border-color:var(--primary);color:var(--primary);font-weight:600;}
.st.on i{background:var(--primary);border-color:var(--primary);color:#fff;}
.steps .cnt{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-left:2px;}
.steps .cnt b{color:var(--primary);}
/* ---------- 每日 10 题 ---------- */
.qwrap{margin-top:12px;background:#fbfcfe;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;}
.qhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:9px;}
.qhead b{color:var(--text);}
.qhead .qc b.g{color:var(--ok);}
.qhead .qc b.r{color:var(--bad);}
.qlist{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(380px,1fr));gap:5px 16px;}
.q .qin{
  width:94px;flex:0 0 94px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;
  padding:2px 8px;font-size:13px;font-family:inherit;background:#fff;color:var(--text);
}
.q .qin:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--primary);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(79,70,229,.12);}
.q .qin::placeholder{color:#c3c8d2;}
.q.qok .qin{border-color:#86efac;background:#f4fdf7;color:#15803d;font-weight:600;}
.q.qbad .qin{border-color:#fca5a5;background:#fff6f6;color:#b91c1c;}
.q{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:7px;font-size:13.5px;padding:3px 5px;border-radius:7px;}
.q.qok{background:#f0faf4;}
.q.qbad{background:#fdf1f1;}
.q .qn{flex:0 0 17px;text-align:right;color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
.q .qt{flex:1;line-height:1.5;}
.q .qb{border:none;background:#f1f2f7;color:#9ca3af;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;line-height:1;padding:0;flex:0 0 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;}
.q .qb:hover{background:#e2e4ea;color:#6b7280;}
.q .qb.on-ok{background:var(--ok);color:#fff;}
.q .qb.on-bad{background:var(--bad);color:#fff;}
.q .qa{color:var(--primary);font-size:12.5px;background:var(--primary-soft);padding:1px 8px;border-radius:6px;white-space:nowrap;}
.q .qa.hidden{display:none;}
.dlab .dt{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:1px;}
.day.today{background:#fffdf3;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #fcd34d;padding:14px 12px;margin:0 -12px;}
.day.today .dlab{background:var(--warm);color:#fff;}
.day.today .dlab .dt{color:#fff5dd;}
.wdates{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;}
.wdates b{color:var(--text);font-weight:600;}

footer{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;padding:0 20px 30px;}

/* ---------- 同步状态 & 弹窗 ---------- */
.syncpill{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12.5px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.16);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);
  color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 13px;
}
.syncpill.ok{background:#dcfce7;border-color:#86efac;color:#15803d;font-weight:600;}
.syncpill.err{background:#fee2e2;border-color:#fca5a5;color:#b91c1c;font-weight:600;}
.syncpill.busy{background:#fef3c7;border-color:#fcd34d;color:#92400e;font-weight:600;}
.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(15,23,42,.55);display:none;z-index:99;overflow:auto;padding:24px 16px;}
.modal.show{display:block;}
.mbox{max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.25);overflow:hidden;}
.mhead{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:14px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#fafbff;}
.mhead b{font-size:16px;}
.mclose{border:none;background:#f1f2f7;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;}
.mclose:hover{background:#e5e7eb;}
.mbody{padding:16px 18px;}
.mrow{margin-bottom:14px;}
.mrow label{display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:5px;}
.mrow input,.mrow textarea{
  width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;
  font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;color:var(--text);background:#fcfcfd;
}
.mrow input:focus,.mrow textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--primary);background:#fff;}
.mrow textarea{min-height:78px;resize:vertical;line-height:1.5;}
.mbtns{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:9px;margin:14px 0 4px;}
.mbtn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:13px;color:var(--text);}
.mbtn:hover{border-color:var(--primary);color:var(--primary);}
.mbtn.primary{background:var(--primary);border-color:var(--primary);color:#fff;font-weight:600;}
.mbtn.primary:hover{opacity:.9;color:#fff;}
.mbtn.danger{color:#b91c1c;border-color:#fca5a5;}
.mnote{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:12.5px;color:#475569;line-height:1.7;}
.mnote b{color:var(--text);}
.mnote code{background:#eef2ff;color:var(--primary);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;}
.sqlbox{background:#0f172a;color:#e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.6;overflow:auto;white-space:pre;margin-top:6px;font-family:Consolas,monospace;}
.mstatus{font-size:13px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:10px;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;line-height:1.6;}
.mstatus b{color:var(--text);}
details.sqlwrap{margin-top:6px;}
details.sqlwrap summary{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--primary);cursor:pointer;}

@media(max-width:900px){
  .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  .side{position:static;}
  .side .weekbtn{display:inline-flex;width:auto;margin:0 6px 8px 0;}
  .stats,.flowbar{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
}
@media print{
  header.top,.side,.top-tools,.legend,footer,.no-print{display:none !important;}
  body{background:#fff;}
  .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;display:block;}
  .weekcard{display:block !important;break-inside:avoid;box-shadow:none;border:1px solid #ddd;margin-bottom:14px;}
  .day{break-inside:avoid;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header class="top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>七七的数学思维 · 12 周训练计划</h1>
    <div class="sub">二年级奥数入门 · 每天 30 分钟 · 口算 → 视频 → 练习 → 说方法</div>
    <div class="sub" id="todayLine" style="font-weight:600"></div>
    <div class="top-tools no-print">
      <button class="tbtn" id="btnToday">跳到今天</button>
      <button class="tbtn" id="btnAll">展开全部 12 周</button>
      <button class="tbtn" id="btnAns">显示参考答案</button>
      <button class="tbtn" id="btnPrint">打印 / 存 PDF</button>
      <button class="tbtn" id="btnCloud">☁️ 云同步 / 同步码</button>
      <span class="syncpill" id="syncStatus">未连接</span>
      <button class="tbtn" id="btnExport">导出 JSON</button>
      <button class="tbtn" id="btnImport">导入 JSON</button>
      <button class="tbtn" id="btnReset">清空记录</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="wrap">

  <div class="flowbar">
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="step">第 1 步</div>
      <div class="t">口算 5 分钟</div>
      <div class="d">热身，先把脑子转起来</div>
      <div class="timer no-print">
        <span class="num" id="tnum">05:00</span>
        <button id="tstart">开始</button>
        <button id="treset">重置</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="step">第 2 步</div>
      <div class="t">视频 10–15 分钟</div>
      <div class="d">或由家长带复习本周方法</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="step">第 3 步</div>
      <div class="t">练习 15 分钟</div>
      <div class="d">做当天的题，旁边标记号</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="step">第 4 步</div>
      <div class="t">一句话总结</div>
      <div class="d">「我今天用了什么方法」</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="k">总进度（已标记天数）</div>
      <div class="v"><span id="sTotal">0</span><small> / 72</small></div>
      <div class="bar"><i id="sTotalBar" style="width:0%"></i></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="k">独立完成 ○</div>
      <div class="v" style="color:var(--ok)"><span id="sOk">0</span><small> 天</small></div>
      <div class="bar"><i id="sOkBar" style="width:0%;background:var(--ok)"></i></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="k">需要提醒 △ / 做错 ×</div>
      <div class="v"><span id="sWarn" style="color:var(--warn)">0</span><small> / </small><span id="sBad" style="color:var(--bad)">0</span></div>
      <div class="bar"><i id="sWBar" style="width:0%;background:var(--warn)"></i></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="k">每日步骤打勾</div>
      <div class="v"><span id="sSteps">0</span><small> / 288</small></div>
      <div class="bar"><i id="sStepsBar" style="width:0%;background:#8b5cf6"></i></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="k">练习题对错</div>
      <div class="v"><span id="sQok" style="color:var(--ok)">0</span><small> / </small><span id="sQbad" style="color:var(--bad)">0</span></div>
      <div class="bar"><i id="sQBar" style="width:0%;background:var(--ok)"></i></div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="k">连续达标周数（○ ≥ 80%）</div>
      <div class="v"><span id="sStreak">0</span><small> 周</small></div>
      <div class="bar"><i id="sStreakBar" style="width:0%;background:var(--warm)"></i></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="notice hidden" id="unlock">
    🎉 <b>已连续两周 ○ 达到 80% 以上</b>，可以进入三年级奥数基础：<b>和差问题、倍数问题、年龄问题</b>。
  </div>

  <div class="layout">
    <aside class="side no-print">
      <p class="side-title">选择周次</p>
      <div id="weekNav"></div>
    </aside>
    <main id="main"></main>
  </div>

  <div class="legend no-print">
    <b>每天在题目旁标一个小记号：</b>
    <div class="row">
      <span><b style="color:var(--primary);font-size:15px">✓</b> 四步打勾：口算 → 视频 → 练习 → 说方法</span>
      <span><b style="font-size:14px">填答案</b> 每题后面直接填，自动判对错；判错时可点右边的方框手动改判</span>
      <span><b style="color:var(--ok);font-size:16px">○</b> 独立完成</span>
      <span><b style="color:var(--warn);font-size:16px">△</b> 需要提醒</span>
      <span><b style="color:var(--bad);font-size:16px">×</b> 不会或做错</span>
      <span>连续两周 ○ 达 80% 以上 → 解锁三年级奥数基础</span>
    </div>
